Error [jet.ThroughLastArm]: `#Through` is on the last arm
  --> tests/ui/through_last_arm.jet:4:27
    |
  4 |         2 -> print("two") #Through
    |                           ^^^^^^^^
 Why: `#Through` runs the next arm's body after this one, and the last arm has no next arm
 Fix: Remove `#Through`, or add the arm it should run on into
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1126

